+## 2026-11-28 — What main lands is read at once (S306p)
+
+**What happened.** Until now a new card, offer or result that main put on the main line waited for the hourly timer, or
+for someone to start the intake by hand. Now every push to the main line starts a round. Nothing another seat pushes
+to its own line starts one, so the code a round runs stays main's own.
